card-image: img/poland/cards/local-structures.webp

= The Forgotten Poland

Razem organisers return from former industrial towns with an accusation. The
party talks about places that lost factories, buses and young people as though
they were difficult markets. They want to call the loss political and promise
public ownership, work and services where private capital has withdrawn.

Socialist line: **[+ hard_left_line_label +]**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation
+]/100**. Lewica polling: **[+ left_poll +]%**. Acceptance of capitalism:
**[+ capitalism_acceptance +]/100**.

- @forgotten_reconstruction
- @forgotten_organisers
- @forgotten_pilots
- @forgotten_refuse

@forgotten_reconstruction
title: Declare a socialist reconstruction programme
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Public works, municipal industry and guaranteed services; KO relation and polling fall.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: A national organising launch needs two resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; hard_left_line += 12; razem_strength += 3; progressives_strength += 1; razem_dissent -= 9; progressives_dissent -= 6; razem_cooperation += 7; workers_support += 5; young_support += 3; rural_support += 4; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 4; local_network += 4; left_economic_position -= 5; left_right_score -= 4; ko_relation -= 7; p2050_relation -= 5; psl_relation -= 4; left_poll -= 0.6; public_trust -= 1; capitalism_acceptance -= 7; barons_dissent += 7; market_liberal_support += 6; news_headline = "Lewica promises socialist reconstruction for the towns capital abandoned"

The programme names public factories, regional rail, guaranteed clinics and
municipal housing in one sentence. It also names the bargain being rejected:
waiting for investment to become profitable enough to return.

- #poland_card_finish

@forgotten_organisers
title: Put organisers and cooperatives in the shrinking towns
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Build the current from below without promising a ministry-sized programme.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The field programme needs one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; hard_left_line += 7; razem_strength += 2; pps_strength += 1; razem_dissent -= 6; progressives_dissent -= 3; razem_cooperation += 4; local_network += 6; organiser_energy += 3; workers_support += 3; rural_support += 3; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 2; left_economic_position -= 2; ko_relation -= 3; psl_relation -= 3; capitalism_acceptance -= 3; barons_dissent += 3; news_headline = "Socialist organisers move into Poland's shrinking towns"

The pledge is smaller, but the organisation is real: tenant advice, worker
buyouts, cooperative workshops and a permanent party room in places visited
by national politicians only during campaigns.

- #poland_card_finish

@forgotten_pilots
title: Offer competitive regional pilots
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Technocratic and legible to the centre; the socialist current remains dissatisfied.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Even a pilot fund needs one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; hard_left_line += 2; local_network += 2; rural_support += 2; public_trust += 1; ko_relation += 1; p2050_relation += 1; razem_dissent += 3; progressives_dissent += 2; razem_cooperation -= 2; market_liberal_support += 1; news_headline = "Lewica replaces reconstruction with a regional pilot fund"

The party promises a competition between local authorities, evaluation after
two years and no commitment to public production. The towns receive projects.
The current hears another invitation to prove that decline is investable.

- #poland_card_finish

@forgotten_refuse
title: Refuse to turn regional policy into class politics
subtitle: Free. Protect relations and polling now; repeated refusals compound socialist dissent.
on-arrival: {!
const refusalAnger = 1 + 0.6 * Math.max(0, Number(Q.hard_left_refusals) || 0);
Q.hard_left_refusals += 1;
Q.poland_forgotten_poland_timer = 5;
Q.razem_dissent += Math.round(7 * refusalAnger);
Q.progressives_dissent += Math.round(4 * refusalAnger);
Q.pps_dissent += Math.round(2 * refusalAnger);
Q.razem_cooperation -= Math.round(4 * refusalAnger);
Q.internal_dissent += Math.round(2 * refusalAnger);
Q.news_headline = "The leadership refuses a socialist reconstruction programme";
!}

The language stays inside the regional-development brief. Nobody has to
defend national ownership on television. Nobody who demanded it mistakes the
silence for agreement.

- #poland_card_finish


@specter
title: A Specter Haunting Poland
