= A Specter Haunting Poland

The younger current is tired of answering every question about communism with
a ritual condemnation and every question about capitalism with an assurance.
It asks for a public congress on the People's Republic, democratic socialism
and the institutions a post-capitalist Poland would require.

Socialist line: **[+ hard_left_line_label +]**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation
+]/100**. Lewica polling: **[+ left_poll +]%**. Acceptance of capitalism:
**[+ capitalism_acceptance +]/100**.

- @specter_congress
- @specter_workers
- @specter_historians
- @specter_refuse

@specter_congress
title: Hold the congress and argue for democratic socialism
subtitle: Name capitalism as the problem. Razem grows; centrist relations, trust and polling take the risk.
on-arrival: hard_left_line += 11; razem_strength += 3; progressives_strength += 2; razem_dissent -= 8; progressives_dissent -= 7; razem_cooperation += 6; progressive_credibility += 4; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 5; young_support += 4; workers_support += 2; left_economic_position -= 4; left_right_score -= 4; capitalism_acceptance -= 8; ko_relation -= 6; p2050_relation -= 5; psl_relation -= 3; left_poll -= 0.5; public_trust -= 2; barons_dissent += 8; spring_dissent += 4; market_liberal_support += 6; news_headline = "Lewica opens a national argument for democratic socialism"

The congress separates one-party rule from public ownership and political
democracy from the private power of wealth. That distinction persuades some
young voters precisely because every opponent insists it cannot be made.

- #poland_card_finish

@specter_workers
title: Ask workers which parts of the old settlement they miss
subtitle: A class argument through wages, housing and security; still uncomfortable, less doctrinal.
on-arrival: hard_left_line += 7; razem_strength += 2; labor_strength += 1; razem_dissent -= 5; progressives_dissent -= 3; razem_cooperation += 4; workers_support += 4; public_sector_support += 3; labor_credibility += 3; union_trust += 2; capitalism_acceptance -= 4; ko_relation -= 3; left_poll -= 0.2; barons_dissent += 3; market_liberal_support += 3; news_headline = "Lewica asks what market transition took from working people"

The meetings do not romanticise police rule or shortages. They also refuse to
treat secure work, cheap housing and social promotion as embarrassing
accidents for which nobody may ask again.

- #poland_card_finish

@specter_historians
title: Commission a balanced historical symposium
subtitle: Experts discuss the period without adopting a socialist conclusion. The current is not satisfied.
on-arrival: public_trust += 1; institutional_trust += 2; pzpr_history_concessions += 1; ko_relation += 1; hard_left_line += 1; razem_dissent += 4; progressives_dissent += 3; pps_dissent += 2; razem_cooperation -= 2; barons_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Lewica sends the argument over communism to a historical symposium"

Every panel has a critic, every proposition has a footnote and the final
report recommends more research. It is responsible history and no answer to
the political question the current placed on the table.

- #poland_card_finish

@specter_refuse
title: Refuse to reopen the communist question
subtitle: Free. Avoid the headline; repeated refusals compound dissent among Razem, progressives and PPS.
on-arrival: {!
