Q.razem_cooperation -= Math.round(4 * refusalAnger);
Q.internal_dissent += Math.round(2 * refusalAnger);
Q.news_headline = "The leadership closes the argument over communism";
!}

The press office calls the subject settled. Three currents immediately begin
planning the meeting without the press office.

- #poland_card_finish


@decommunisation
