card-image: img/poland/cards/programme-convention.webp

= The Internationale

Youth delegates want the next convention to close with *The Internationale*
and an address that uses the words class, ownership and socialism without
qualification. The communications team says the clip will define the party
for a year. The delegates answer that this is the purpose.

Socialist line: **[+ hard_left_line_label +]**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation
+]/100**. Lewica polling: **[+ left_poll +]%**. Acceptance of capitalism:
**[+ capitalism_acceptance +]/100**.

- @internationale_sing
- @internationale_polish
- @internationale_archive
- @internationale_refuse

@internationale_sing
title: Sing it and publish an openly socialist declaration
subtitle: Harden the line in full view. Razem gains, as does support among young adults and students; relations and polling take the hit.
on-arrival: hard_left_line += 12; razem_strength += 4; progressives_strength += 2; pps_strength += 1; razem_dissent -= 10; progressives_dissent -= 7; pps_dissent -= 4; razem_cooperation += 7; young_support += 5; workers_support += 3; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 6; anti_system_trust += 3; movement_autonomy += 4; left_economic_position -= 4; left_right_score -= 5; capitalism_acceptance -= 8; ko_relation -= 8; p2050_relation -= 6; psl_relation -= 4; left_poll -= 0.7; public_trust -= 2; barons_dissent += 8; spring_dissent += 5; market_liberal_support += 7; news_headline = "The Internationale closes Lewica's openly socialist convention"

The declaration commits the party to replacing private domination with
democratic ownership. The hall knows every camera is recording. It sings
anyway.

- #poland_card_finish

@internationale_polish
title: Pair the anthem with a Polish democratic-socialist programme
subtitle: Keep the symbol, anchor it in PPS democracy, unions and present-day public ownership.
on-arrival: hard_left_line += 8; razem_strength += 2; pps_strength += 2; razem_dissent -= 6; progressives_dissent -= 4; pps_dissent -= 5; razem_cooperation += 4; young_support += 3; workers_support += 3; labor_credibility += 2; universal_solidarity += 3; capitalism_acceptance -= 4; ko_relation -= 4; psl_relation -= 2; left_poll -= 0.2; barons_dissent += 3; market_liberal_support += 3; news_headline = "Lewica places The Internationale inside a Polish democratic-socialist tradition"

The speech begins with the 1905 revolution and ends with worker representation
on public boards. It does not soften the symbol. It explains what democratic
power would mean after the music stops.

- #poland_card_finish

@internationale_archive
title: Keep the song for the historical evening
subtitle: A cultural acknowledgement without a programme. The current hears containment, not respect.
on-arrival: hard_left_line += 2; pps_heritage_claimed = 1; public_trust += 1; ko_relation += 1; pps_dissent -= 1; razem_dissent += 4; progressives_dissent += 3; razem_cooperation -= 2; coalition_blur += 2; news_headline = "Lewica places The Internationale in the convention's historical programme"

The archive film is tasteful, the veterans are thanked and the policy session
starts after the song has ended. Nobody can say the tradition was erased.
Nobody can say it was allowed to govern a sentence either.

- #poland_card_finish

@internationale_refuse
title: Refuse the anthem and the socialist declaration
subtitle: Free. Keep the convention safe for coalition partners; repeated refusals compound dissent.
on-arrival: {!
