Q.razem_cooperation -= Math.round(4 * refusalAnger);
Q.internal_dissent += Math.round(2 * refusalAnger);
Q.news_headline = "The leadership removes The Internationale from the convention";
!}

The convention closes to licensed pop music. The youth delegates hold their
own closing session outside and make certain its video has the better sound.

- #poland_card_finish


