= Neither Polish, nor Socialist

PPS asks whether a Left detached from Polish independence and a patriotism
detached from socialism can claim its inheritance. A portrait at a congress
costs the leadership nothing. Workplace democracy, public ownership and a
republic stronger than private wealth would change the party that displays it.

Socialist line: **[+ hard_left_line_label +]**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation
+]/100**. Lewica polling: **[+ left_poll +]%**. Acceptance of capitalism:
**[+ capitalism_acceptance +]/100**.

- @pps_living
- @pps_programme
- @pps_foundation
- @pps_refuse

@pps_living
title: Claim PPS as Lewica's living democratic-socialist tradition
subtitle: Put public ownership and republican liberty into the party programme. The market wing mobilises against it.
on-arrival: pps_heritage_claimed = 1; hard_left_line += 10; pps_strength += 4; razem_strength += 3; progressives_strength += 1; pps_dissent -= 9; razem_dissent -= 7; progressives_dissent -= 5; razem_cooperation += 6; workers_support += 4; public_sector_support += 3; universal_solidarity += 4; labor_credibility += 3; left_economic_position -= 4; left_right_score -= 3; capitalism_acceptance -= 6; ko_relation -= 6; p2050_relation -= 4; psl_relation -= 3; left_poll -= 0.4; barons_dissent += 5; spring_dissent += 3; market_liberal_support += 6; news_headline = "Lewica claims PPS as a living democratic-socialist programme"

The resolution links national independence to freedom from private economic
power. PPS ceases to be a source of quotations and becomes a current whose
programme the whole party has adopted.

- #poland_card_finish

@pps_programme
title: Give PPS co-ownership of the programme convention
subtitle: Share drafting power with PPS and Razem. A smaller commitment, still explicitly socialist.
on-arrival: pps_heritage_claimed = 1; hard_left_line += 7; pps_strength += 3; razem_strength += 2; pps_dissent -= 7; razem_dissent -= 5; progressives_dissent -= 3; razem_cooperation += 4; party_unity += 1; workers_support += 2; left_economic_position -= 2; capitalism_acceptance -= 3; ko_relation -= 3; psl_relation -= 2; barons_dissent += 3; market_liberal_support += 3; news_headline = "PPS and Razem receive joint ownership of Lewica's programme convention"

PPS drafts the democratic safeguards, Razem drafts ownership and labour, and
the leadership loses the ability to remove either half without a recorded
vote.

- #poland_card_finish

